  "forbidden_beats": [
    {
      "id": "97-S4-F1",
      "description": "不得用“三人都看破了”或三段判词式结论收尾；不得统一成佛偈、望夫诗或悟道宣言。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
        "seed": {
          "path": "data/prewrite/v06.json",
          "pointer": "/omitted_scene_plans/16/candidate_scenes/3",
          "ref": "data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/16/candidate_scenes/3",
          "sha256": "caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff",
          "text_sha256": "7f1af6b18982e8ebd481f7c7fc015017cd43dc2fae971a213c4c3df6d1bd4f43",
          "value": {
            "id": "97-S4",
            "title": "三线收束不应各自“判词式结论”"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                43464,
                43588
              ],
              "lines": [
                1092,
                1094
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "11777bf5d02cd7d980fb5067000917be0adb8b30743da166b50623d2fc95227b"
            },
            "name": "最薄处",
            "number": 3,
            "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n当前三大块仍略像“三个结局说明”；需改成交叉互照，但不能使三人同义。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                44259,
                44372
              ],
              "lines": [
                1106,
                1108
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "0045c275f11629e1d3f0e544127a45f38796d5890cd5ff5df3c51fad60ebb210"
            },
            "name": "诗文身份",
            "number": 7,
            "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \n湘云无完整新诗；妙玉无偈；惜春无偈/终极画跋。实用书写即足。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                44481,
                44664
              ],
              "lines": [
                1112,
                1114
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "400c9af47afb8926552ec4466ca0f9fa863bc4d6788b2b2a86b3e8aa09db4183"
            },
            "name": "宗教/梦",
            "number": 9,
            "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n41最高重点：妙玉=洁与尘，不“终于悟”；惜春=断与冷，不“件件想明白”。湘云门栓错听只作梦阈，不升级若兰托梦。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                45080,
                45197
              ],
              "lines": [
                1124,
                1126
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "de902b88f3f91947d35faf70b46c31da966dbde1a065d9f108f2f060d2a27c09"
            },
            "name": "应删",
            "number": 13,
            "text": "**13｜应删**  \n“三人都看破了”的作者句；妙玉佛偈；惜春悟道宣言；湘云望夫诗/梦。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "97-S4-F2",
      "description": "不得因并置产生同地会合、消息互通或确定湘卫/瓜州终局；也不得追加文化名物使动作失焦。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
        "seed": {
          "path": "data/prewrite/v06.json",
          "pointer": "/omitted_scene_plans/16/candidate_scenes/3",
          "ref": "data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/16/candidate_scenes/3",
          "sha256": "caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff",
          "text_sha256": "7f1af6b18982e8ebd481f7c7fc015017cd43dc2fae971a213c4c3df6d1bd4f43",
          "value": {
            "id": "97-S4",
            "title": "三线收束不应各自“判词式结论”"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                43034,
                43195
              ],
              "lines": [
                1086,
                1088
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "51e0f8952a21bb0a8094a1fcaba0d209642709bf4ef8e896ccf40002c09f9f27"
            },
            "name": "硬节点",
            "number": 1,
            "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR34湘云/若兰关联但O06终局开放；R41妙玉“欲洁未洁、终陷淖泥”方向，瓜州具体遭遇不锁；R33惜春为尼。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                44127,
                44259
              ],
              "lines": [
                1103,
                1105
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "45bde41bfe1fa89c358331a06c0b9bc95ef15c92ca55a6ee28357b58a628ca3f"
            },
            "name": "文化",
            "number": 6,
            "text": "**6｜文化**  \n97文化动作已充分，保护不增：不找“终极大观园残图”，不加名茶名器、高僧书法。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                45497,
                45796
              ],
              "lines": [
                1136,
                1139
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "633a4c663bd35ced1c40a1a793abbb659b0e2829bce7bea227aa7edae03fe696"
            },
            "name": "章法 / 风险",
            "number": 18,
            "text": "**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n饭母题三线切换 → 衣母题三线切换 → 纸母题三线切换 → 宝玉探惜春作为现实交叉点 → 三处分别收束。  \n**压力测试问题：**交叉后是否仍能一眼区分三个人；“哲学更深”是否完全依赖动作而非议论。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
