    {
      "id": "97-S4-R3",
      "description": "宝玉仅探惜春，是S11一处现实交叉而非三线全知使者；M3 knowledge_rules/7的MUTUAL_NONKNOWLEDGE只作义务依据，不新增v03事实或获取事件。三人名单是跨段编排主体，完整localcast仍PENDING。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "AUTHORING_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
